 ],
 "literal": "Just like virtue stands in the heart of those who know moderation, deceit stands in the heart of those who know theft.",
 "translation": "Just as virtue abides in the hearts of those who know the limits of proper conduct, deceit dwells in the minds of those who practice theft.",
